  <section|matplotlib测试>

  <subsection|如果未安装matplotlib库：>

  <\session|python|default>
    <\output>
      Python 3.12.1 [C:\\Python312\\python.exe]

      Python plugin for TeXmacs.

      Please see the documentation in Help -\<gtr\> Plugins -\<gtr\> Python
    </output>

